#. module: coa_account_merge
#: model:ir.model,name:coa_account_merge.model_coa_account_merge_wizard
msgid "Merge Accounts"
msgstr "دمج الحسابات"

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: model:ir.actions.act_window,name:coa_account_merge.action_coa_account_merge_wizard
msgid "Merge Accounts"
msgstr "دمج الحسابات"

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: model:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coa_account_merge.view_coa_account_merge_wizard_form
msgid "Merge Accounts"
msgstr "دمج الحسابات"

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coa_account_merge.view_coa_account_merge_wizard_form
msgid ""
"All journal items and every reference (journals, taxes,\n"
"                    products, partners, ...) of the source accounts will be\n"
"                    moved to the destination account. The source accounts\n"
"                    will be archived. This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"سيتم نقل جميع قيود اليومية وكل مرجع (يوميات، ضرائب،\n"
"                    منتجات، شركاء، ...) من الحسابات المصدر إلى\n"
"                    الحساب الوجهة. ستُؤرشف الحسابات المصدر. لا يمكن التراجع عن هذه العملية."

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:coa_account_merge.field_coa_account_merge_wizard__account_ids
msgid "Accounts to Merge"
msgstr "الحسابات المراد دمجها"

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:coa_account_merge.field_coa_account_merge_wizard__destination_account_id
msgid "Destination Account"
msgstr "الحساب الوجهة"

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:coa_account_merge.field_coa_account_merge_wizard__allow_different_types
msgid "Allow Different Types"
msgstr "السماح بأنواع مختلفة"

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:coa_account_merge.field_coa_account_merge_wizard__line_count
msgid "Journal Items to Move"
msgstr "قيود اليومية التي ستُنقل"

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: code:addons/coa_account_merge/wizard/account_merge_wizard.py:0
msgid "Only Accounting Administrators can merge accounts."
msgstr "فقط مديرو المحاسبة يمكنهم دمج الحسابات."

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: code:addons/coa_account_merge/wizard/account_merge_wizard.py:0
msgid "The destination account must be one of the selected accounts."
msgstr "يجب أن يكون الحساب الوجهة ضمن الحسابات المحددة."

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: code:addons/coa_account_merge/wizard/account_merge_wizard.py:0
msgid "Select at least two different accounts."
msgstr "يرجى تحديد حسابين مختلفين على الأقل."

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: code:addons/coa_account_merge/wizard/account_merge_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"All selected accounts must belong to the same "
"company scope. \"%(src)s\" and \"%(dest)s\" differ."
msgstr ""
"يجب أن تنتمي جميع الحسابات المحددة إلى نفس نطاق الشركة. "
"الحساب \"%(src)s\" والحساب \"%(dest)s\" مختلفان."

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: code:addons/coa_account_merge/wizard/account_merge_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"The following accounts have a different type than the "
"destination (%(dest_type)s):\n%(accounts)s\n\n"
"Tick \"Allow Different Types\" if you really intend to "
"merge them."
msgstr ""
"الحسابات التالية لها نوع مختلف عن الحساب الوجهة (%(dest_type)s):\n%(accounts)s\n\n"
"ضع علامة على \"السماح بأنواع مختلفة\" إذا كنت تنوي دمجها فعلاً."

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: code:addons/coa_account_merge/wizard/account_merge_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"%(count)s journal items on the source accounts belong "
"to hashed (inalterable) entries and cannot be moved. "
"The merge is not possible for these accounts."
msgstr ""
"%(count)s قيد يومية في الحسابات المصدر تنتمي إلى قيود محمية "
"(inalterable) ولا يمكن نقلها. "
"عملية الدمج غير ممكنة لهذه الحسابات."

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: code:addons/coa_account_merge/wizard/account_merge_wizard.py:0
msgid "Accounts Merged"
msgstr "تم دمج الحسابات بنجاح"

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: code:addons/coa_account_merge/wizard/account_merge_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"%(count)s journal items and all references were "
"moved to %(dest)s. Source accounts were archived."
msgstr ""
"تم نقل %(count)s قيد يومية وجميع المراجع إلى %(dest)s. "
"تمت أرشفة الحسابات المصدر."

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coa_account_merge.view_coa_account_merge_wizard_form
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "إلغاء"

#. module: coa_account_merge
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coa_account_merge.view_coa_account_merge_wizard_form
msgid ""
"Are you sure? All movements will be transferred to the destination account "
"and the source accounts will be archived. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"هل أنت متأكد؟ سيتم نقل جميع الحركات إلى الحساب الوجهة "
"وستُؤرشف الحسابات المصدر. لا يمكن التراجع عن هذا الإجراء."
